  "note": "Ps29 (8 chars). Storm-theophany, qol YHWH sevenfold. kavod glory x4 (ascribe/God of glory/cry Glory!), hadar majesty, shachah worship, closes on shalom peace-blessing. Poetic ledger; span-id pairs.",
  "spans": {
    "276418": {"gloss":"glory v1","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"glory (kavod - ascribe glory)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the LORD (ascribed by heavenly beings)","to":276418,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"ascribe","to":276418,"res":"inferred"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'Ascribe to the LORD GLORY (kavod) and strength' — the heavenly beings summoned to render glory; kavod the weight of splendour the psalm calls the sons of God to acknowledge, first of four (v1,2,3,9)"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "276437": {"gloss":"glory v2","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"glory (kavod - due his name)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the LORD","to":276437,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with worship","from":276437,"to":276439,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'Ascribe the GLORY (kavod) due his name; worship in the splendour of holiness' — glory owed to God's name; kavod here joined to worship, the fitting response of reverence to the holy One"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "276439": {"gloss":"worship v2","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"worship / bow down (shachah)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the heavenly beings / worshippers","to":276439,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"worship"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"the LORD","to":276439,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"in the splendour of holiness","to":276439,"res":"inferred"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with ascribing glory","from":276439,"to":276437,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'WORSHIP (shachah) the LORD in the splendour of holiness' — prostration before the holy God; shachah the bowing homage, the inner posture of reverence answering God's glory"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "276447": {"gloss":"glory v3","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"glory (kavod - the God of glory thunders)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the LORD (God of glory)","to":276447,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'The God of GLORY (kavod) thunders' — glory revealed in the storm's voice; kavod here God manifest in thunder over the waters, majesty audible in the qol YHWH"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "276458": {"gloss":"majesty v4","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"majesty / splendour (hadar)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the voice of the LORD","to":276458,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'the voice of the LORD is full of MAJESTY (hadar)' — the storm-voice robed in splendour; hadar (as Ps21:5) the regal glory of God's voice, powerful and majestic"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "276489": {"gloss":"Glory v9","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"glory (kavod - all cry 'Glory!')"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the LORD (glory cried in his temple)","to":276489,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"cry","to":276489,"res":"inferred"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'and in his temple all cry, GLORY (kavod)!' — the worshippers' response to the storm-display; kavod the one-word acclamation, the climax of the ascribing (v1) — heaven and temple answering with 'Glory!'"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "276432": {"gloss":"bless v11","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"bless (barak)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the LORD","to":276432,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"bless"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"his people (with peace)","from":276432,"to":276434,"res":"span"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with peace","from":276432,"to":276434,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'May the LORD BLESS (barak) his people with peace!' — the storm-God's gift to his own; barak the blessing that follows the display of power, the mighty voice turned to bless"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "276434": {"gloss":"peace v11","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"peace (shalom)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"his people (blessed with it)","to":276434,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"the content of the blessing","from":276434,"to":276432,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'bless his people with PEACE (shalom)' — the peace that crowns the psalm; shalom here the wholeness/well-being God grants his people, the storm's terror resolving into peace for the faithful (contrast the false shalom of Ps28:3)"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "276474": {"gloss":"shakes v8","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"shake / whirl (chul - the voice shakes the wilderness)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"v8: 'The voice of the LORD SHAKES (chul) the wilderness' - the qol YHWH convulsing creation; the whole earth trembling before God's voice, the theophany's power (the sevenfold 'voice of the LORD' v3-9 that breaks cedars, flashes fire, shakes the desert)"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"standalone"}]},
    "276426": {"gloss":"enthroned v10","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"enthroned as king forever (over the flood)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"v10: 'The LORD sits ENTHRONED over the flood; the LORD sits enthroned as king FOREVER' - God's sovereign kingship above the chaos-waters; the storm mastered, the LORD reigning over the flood as eternal king, the settled ground of the peace he gives (v11)"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"standalone"}]}
